id: elemental-tool
name: Elemental Tool
kind: crafting
weaponType: magic
source: Core Rule
description: >
  An Elemental Profile chosen when it is made: wielded, that Element is a Favored Element.
text: >
  Elemental Tool: This Weapon possesses the mystical means to influence the natural world, and
  may not look like a Weapon at all.
  –Effects: Upon creating this Weapon, select a Profile with ‘Elemental’ in the name. While
  wielding this Weapon, that Element becomes a Favored Element.

---

# --- What is not built ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
#
# A Favored Element is not in this system, and neither is what one does. When it is: the
# Elemental Profile chosen when the Weapon is made, and that Element Favored while it is wielded.
